AudD  ·  profile default
                 │ Run a command
 1 Recognize     > >                                                           
 2 Now playing   │ 
 3 Streams       │ > completion      Print a shell completion script
 4 History       │   docs            Print AudD documentation as markdown
 5 Account       │   now-playing     Show the latest songs on your streams
 6 Settings      │   recognize       Identify music in files, URLs, and folders
 7 Help          │   streams add     Add a stream to monitor
                 │   streams remove  Stop monitoring a stream
                 │   streams report  Plays grouped
